{
  "changelog": "Initial release of npc-distill:  \n- Enables building local digital personas of specific individuals for practice, drafting, and decision simulation.  \n- Supports ingesting text, URLs, or user intentions (e.g., \u201c\u7ec3\u4e60\u6c47\u62a5\u201d, \u201c\u6a21\u62df NPC \u53cd\u5e94\u201d) to trigger actions.  \n- All data stored locally using anonymized codes (L001/L002), prioritizing privacy and open-source scenarios.  \n- Provides 5 core workflows: text ingestion, URL ingestion, pressure testing, dialogue rehearsal, and stylized drafting.  \n- Compatible with Claude Skills, Hermes Agent, LobsterAI, OpenClaw, and other agentskills.io-compliant platforms.  \n- Comprehensive troubleshooting and known limitations documented for user reference.",
